    "@value" : "Refers to the statistical analysis of the occurrence of floods at a particular location over a defined time period. It often involves calculating the recurrence intervals or return periods of flood events, which are typically used to understand how often a specific flood magnitude (like a 100-year flood) is likely to occur. Source: Introduction to Flood Frequency Analysis"
