    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Knife can be pushed into the moist soil with weak pressure, sample disintegrates into few fragments, which may be further divided."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/bulkDensityMineralValueCode-BD4",
