    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Mass movements are defined as processes of erosion, transport and accumulation of material that occur on both gentle and steep slopes mainly owing to gravitational forces."
  } ],
